      "writtenOn": "2023-11-24T11:19:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the name is only descriptive here. Based on the sample Keymint chain David dumped from the Keymint CTS test[1], the cert added by Keymint is also like this without a unique identifier, though the RKP cert\u0027s subject also includes its serial number.\n\n@drysdale@google.com FYI\n\n[1] http://gpaste/5934310218006528",
