      "lineNbr": 66,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-24T11:34:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interesting.\n\nI also note over there that the leaf cert has \"X509v3 Key Usage: critical Key Encipherment, Data Encipherment\".\n\nWe\u0027re going to need \"Certificate Signing\", or we can\u0027t validly extend the chain.\n\nSomething to discuss with Seth?",
      "parentUuid": "e6d15b51_fc4335bb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 66,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 66,
        "endChar": 84
      },
      "revId": "9cd45f53fe79b98aad290a70c1ba6284382adb1b",
